import streamlit as st

st.title("Executive Summary")
st.write("When pool cues are not being maintained, the cue tips flatten down over time, and when chalking flatter tips in a round chalk divot, it is difficult to get chalk on the entire tip. " \
"It is important for cues to be fully and evenly chalked, because chalk increases the friction between the ball and cue, allowing the player to play a larger variety of shots.")
st.write("The scope of the project is to create a product that helps users chalk cue tips that are flat or round evenly.")
st.write("We began looking at the problem by observing players at public pool halls and asking them about their experiences with chalking cues. " \
"With that information, we created prototypes for different designs that we wanted to test out. " \
"We tested our product with students and observed how they approached our product with no prior knowledge of it.")
st.write("Our product, the Chalk Pop, is a handheld cue tip chalker. It is composed of a palm grip, a shroud, and a piece of rounded chalk. More specifically, our product is a semi-spherical piece of chalk surrounded by a shroud on a hand grip. " \
"To evenly apply chalk on all different pool cue tips shapes, the user uses circular motions around the chalk to reach all areas of the cue tip. The shroud surrounding the chalk is a guide to help build intuition on how the product is used, in circular motions around the semi-sphere.  ")
st.image("chalk_pop.png", "Figure 1: The Chalk Pop")